  "id": "neural-arc",
  "term": "neural arc",
  "definition": "In this context, the neural arc is the nerve-controlled part of the baroreflex. Resetting or augmenting this neural arc can raise sympathetic nerve activity and influence blood flow dynamics during acute inflammation.",
